es/Velocidades_Bitcarrier_Octubre_2020/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":8181,"scoreCompleteness":100,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1793394000000,"source":"Secretaría Distrital de Movilidad","licenseConstraintId":"CC-BY-4.0"},{"id":"8a60fecdace64bdc864bf44eb1ebe8ca","owner":"STM_OMC","created":1743021789000,"modified":1779252170000,"guid":null,"name":"survey123_11c4079be8e24d649b9b300cc3f3aea2_results","title":"Velocidades Cundinamarca - Bogota_results","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["11c4079be8e24d649b9b300cc3f3aea2","ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","StakeholderView","Survey123","Survey123 Hub","Hosted Service","View Service"],"description":"<p>Los datos que son reportados en esta capa son elementos sin localización específica en la capa, no obstante, generan información para tramos asociados a vías de conexión entre Cundinamarca y Bogotá, los cuales permiten la generación del tablero de \"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://cundinamarca-map.maps.arcgis.com/apps/dashboards/bd0d63d8eed84d1f874665725796b620\">Reporte de velocidades entradas y salidas Cundinamarca y Bogotá<\/a>\".<\/p><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Los datos son actualizados diariamente en diferentes periodos del día, y permite conocer variaciones respecto a una velocidad deseada y la realmente dada en operación, los datos reportados son obtenidos de Google Maps, mediante consultas manuales.<\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Los corredores o rutas registradas son 7 asociados con:<\/div><div>- Carrera 7<\/div><div>- Autopista Norte<\/div><div>- Calle 80<\/div><div>- Calle 13<\/div><div>- Soacha<\/div><div>- Villavicencia<\/div><div>- Calera<\/d